sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant REPLAY as Chronological Replay
    participant RT as Python StrategyRuntime
    participant POS as PositionEngine
    participant RISK as RiskPolicy
    participant BBO as BBO Timeline
    participant FILL as ExecutionSimulator
    participant FACT as TradeFact Builder

    REPLAY->>RT: causal context at candle close t
    RT-->>REPLAY: Signal(BUY/SELL/HOLD, signal_t, evidence)
    REPLAY->>POS: apply signal to state FLAT/LONG/SHORT

    alt FLAT + BUY
        POS->>FILL: open LONG order at next executable event
        FILL->>BBO: first BBO with event_time > signal_t
        BBO-->>FILL: best_ask, ask_qty, best_bid, bid_qty
        FILL->>FILL: buy at ask + configured slippage<br/>subject to available quantity
        FILL-->>POS: LONG entry fill
    else FLAT + SELL
        POS->>FILL: open SHORT order at next executable event
        FILL->>BBO: first BBO after signal_t
        BBO-->>FILL: bid/ask + quantities
        FILL->>FILL: sell at bid - configured slippage
        FILL-->>POS: SHORT entry fill
    else LONG + SELL or SHORT + BUY
        POS->>FILL: close/reverse according to position policy
    end

    loop every ordered BBO/candle event while position open
        POS->>RISK: evaluate SL/TP/exit signal without future access
        alt recorded BBO can execute trigger
            RISK->>FILL: exit order
            FILL->>BBO: executable side/price/quantity
            FILL-->>FACT: entry + exit fills
        else no BBO coverage
            RISK->>FILL: documented candle fallback
            FILL->>FILL: conservative intrabar priority<br/>+ fixed 5 bps fallback
            FILL-->>FACT: fill with fallback_used=true
        end
    end

    FACT->>FACT: compute gross_pnl<br/>entry_fee + exit_fee<br/>spread_cost + slippage_cost<br/>net_pnl and pnl_pct
    FACT-->>REPLAY: immutable TradeFact

    Note over BBO,FACT: BUY sử dụng ask, SELL sử dụng bid.<br/>Mọi fallback và assumption phải nằm trong provenance,<br/>không được âm thầm dùng candle close.
